# 🚀 Terraform + GitHub Actions & Azure OIDC Complete Guide

A simple, end-to-end reference guide explaining how your CI/CD pipeline, scripts, Azure authentication, and secrets work together.

---

## 1. 🔄 Complete Workflow Flowchart

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([User clicks 'Run Workflow']) --> Inputs[Select Workspace & Action]
    Inputs --> PlanJob[Job 1: PLAN - self-hosted runner]

    subgraph PlanJobSteps [Plan Execution]
        P1[Azure Login via OIDC] --> P2[terraform-backend-init.sh]
        P2 --> P3[plan.sh]
        P3 --> P4[Generate workspace.tfplan]
        P4 --> P5[Upload .tfplan Artifact]
    end

    PlanJob --> PlanJobSteps

    PlanJobSteps --> Decision{Action == 'apply' ?}
    Decision -- No (plan only) --> EndDone([Finish: Preview Only])
    Decision -- Yes --> ApprovalGate{Environment Approval Gate}

    subgraph Approval [Optional Security Gate]
        ApprovalGate -- Waiting for Approval --> Reviewer([Reviewer Approves in GitHub])
    end

    Reviewer --> ApplyJob[Job 2: APPLY - self-hosted runner]

    subgraph ApplyJobSteps [Apply Execution]
        A1[Download workspace.tfplan] --> A2[Azure Login via OIDC]
        A2 --> A3[terraform-backend-init.sh]
        A3 --> A4[apply.sh]
        A4 --> A5[(Azure Cloud: Resources Created)]
    end

    ApplyJob --> ApplyJobSteps
    ApplyJobSteps --> Done([Deployment Complete!])
```

