## 3. 📜 Scripts ki Working (Short & Sweet)

| Script | Kya karti hai? | Main Command | Output |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`terraform-backend-init.sh`** | Workspace ke naam ka container select karke Azure Storage se state connect karti hai. | `terraform init -reconfigure -backend-config="container_name=$WORKSPACE"` | State Connected |
| **`plan.sh`** | Workspace ke `.tfvars` se Azure ko compare karti hai aur ek sealed blueprint file banati hai. | `terraform plan -var-file="$TFVARS" -out="$PLAN_FILE"` | `${WORKSPACE}.tfplan` |
| **`apply.sh`** | Upar bani hui `.tfplan` file ko Azure par apply kar deti hai (Koi naya calculation nahi). | `terraform apply -input=false "$PLAN_FILE"` | Resources Deployed |

