## 5. 🔐 GitHub Secrets (Kahan aur Kaise Daalein)

### Kahan jaakar add karna hai?
1. GitHub Repo: `https://github.com/ankitgodbole/terrafrom`
2. **Settings** (Top tab) → Left menu mein **Secrets and variables** → **Actions**.
3. Click green button: **New repository secret**.

### Kaun-kaun se Secrets add karne hain?

| Secret Name | Value kahan se milegi? | Kiske liye use hota hai? |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`AZURE_CLIENT_ID`** | Azure App Registration → **Application (client) ID** | Azure login aur OIDC identity ke liye |
| **`AZURE_TENANT_ID`** | Azure App Registration → **Directory (tenant) ID** | Company / Tenant pehchanne ke liye |
| **`AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET`** | Azure App Registration → *Certificates & secrets* → *New client secret* | Terraform variables (`TF_VAR_client_secret`) ke liye |
| **`QG_SHARED_CLIENT_ID`** | Shared App Registration ki Client ID | Sirf `spokes-*` workspaces ke liye |
| **`QG_SHARED_CLIENT_SECRET`** | Shared App Registration ka Client Secret | Sirf `spokes-*` workspaces ke liye |

